  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your opponent aims low, sinking his weapon into the bony iliac crest high on your hip. Despite a nasty crunch your pelvis is only lightly chipped, your mobility unimpaired.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1). Unless you pass an <strong>Average (+20) Endurance</strong> Test you are also @Condition[Stunned] (1), except you’ll not suffer any @Condition[Fatigued] Condition to replace it once removed. An Impressive Failure (-4 SL or more) will also leave you @Condition[Prone].</p>"
    },
